# {{svc}}

DDD six-module Maven microservice skeleton generated by start.spring.io (`ddd-six-module`).

## Modules

| Module | Role |
|--------|------|
| `{{svc}}-contract` | DTOs / constants / enums + module-local `contract.common` (`PageResult`, `SnowflakeIdGenerator`) |
| `{{svc}}-feign-client` | Feign API + fallback (mirrors Controller) |
| `{{svc}}-domain` | Pure Java domain + `BusinessException` |
| `{{svc}}-infrastructure` | MyBatis-Plus persistence + `*ReadMapper` (CQRS) |
| `{{svc}}-application` | Controllers / app services / QueryServiceImpl(ReadMapper) |
| `{{svc}}-bootstrap` | Spring Boot main + `application.yml` + Flyway |

## Profiles

| Profile | DB | Flyway | When |
|---------|----|--------|------|
| *(default)* | PostgreSQL | ON (`db/migration`) | normal / prod-like |
| `h2` | in-memory H2 (`MODE=PostgreSQL`) | OFF; `schema-h2.sql` | local smoke |

```bash
./mvnw -pl {{svc}}-bootstrap -am package
java -jar {{svc}}-bootstrap/target/*.jar --spring.profiles.active=h2
```

## Conventions

- **IDs**: Snowflake (`SnowflakeIdGenerator` + PO `@TableId(ASSIGN_ID)`), not UUID.
- **Soft delete**: `BOOLEAN deleted` + `@TableLogic`.
- **Pagination**: `PageResult` in `contract.common.page` (never expose MP `IPage`).
- **CQRS read**: `*ReadMapper` + XML projection; writes stay on domain Repository port.
- **Jackson 3**: use `tools.jackson.*` if you add JSONB handlers; ArchUnit bans `com.fasterxml.jackson`.

